sequenceDiagram
    participant Transport as Transport Service
    participant VendorMgmt as Vendor Management Service
    participant Vendor as Vendor Mobile
    participant Notif as Notifications Service
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    Transport->>Transport: Create Transport Order (Vendor Fleet)
    Transport->>EventBus: Publish TransportOrderCreated
    EventBus->>VendorMgmt: TransportOrderCreated Event
    EventBus->>Notif: TransportOrderCreated Event
    Notif->>Notif: Notify Vendors

    Note over Vendor: Multiple Vendors Receive Notification

    Vendor->>VendorMgmt: Submit Bid
    VendorMgmt->>VendorMgmt: Validate Bid
    VendorMgmt->>VendorMgmt: Save Bid
    VendorMgmt->>EventBus: Publish VendorBidSubmitted
    EventBus->>Notif: VendorBidSubmitted Event
    Notif->>Notif: Notify Logistics Team
    VendorMgmt->>Vendor: Return Bid Confirmation

    Note over Transport: Logistics Team Reviews Bids

    Transport->>VendorMgmt: Accept Bid
    VendorMgmt->>VendorMgmt: Update Bid Status (ACCEPTED)
    VendorMgmt->>EventBus: Publish VendorBidAccepted
    EventBus->>Transport: VendorBidAccepted Event
    EventBus->>Notif: VendorBidAccepted Event
    Notif->>Vendor: Notify Winning Vendor
    Notif->>Notif: Notify Other Vendors (Rejected)

    Transport->>Transport: Assign Vendor to TO
    Transport->>EventBus: Publish VendorAssigned
    EventBus->>VendorMgmt: VendorAssigned Event
    VendorMgmt->>Vendor: Notify Assignment

    Note over Vendor: Vendor Prepares for Trip

